==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ar}} {{term|رمضان||tr=ramaɖáːn|sc=Arab}}, from {{term|ارتمض||to be consumed by grief and sorrow|tr=irtámaɖa|sc=Arab}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ɹæməˈdɑːn/|/ˈɹæmədæn/}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# {{Islam}} The [[holy]] ninth [[month]] of the [[Islamic]] [[lunar]] [[calendar]] (the [[Hijra]]), during which [[Muslim]]s [[fast]] between [[sunrise]] and [[sunset]]; they also refrain from [[smoking]], [[sexual]] [[relation]]s, and various other desires and emotions.

